Hand-off package for the letters-to-sprites migration, split by audience:

- assets/sprites/ART_BRIEF.md — art brief for claude.design: full unit
  roster (Soldier/Archer/Mage/Priest/Necromancer, Zombie/Skeleton,
  Cavalry/Templar Rider composites, Horse/Warhorse/Scorpion), mounted =
  rider+mount composite that decomposes into matching parts, canvas sizes
  scaled by unit SIZE, standard idle/walk/attack/death rig, team-color
  strategy (neutral base + team-mask, recommended), isometric authoring
  conventions, terrain tiles + elevation skirts + edge overlays, and a
  large future library (props, fortifications, decals, FX, and a full
  bestiary: giants/trolls/dragons/chariots/lizardmen/centaurs/nymphs/
  summons) batched now for one style-locked pass.
- assets/sprites/manifest.example.json — machine-readable art/engine
  contract (per-sprite file, frame size, anchor, animations, variants,
  team-color mode) with the full planned roster.
- docs/RENDERING_PLAN.md — engine-side plan for the isometric renderer
  do-over: projection + painter's depth sort, terrain/elevation rendering,
  manifest/texture loading, unit sprite + team-mask tinting, and an
  incremental migration order from the current letter renderer.

